143:## 8. Host keyword proposal contract
144-
145:### 8.1 Default host policy
146-
147-- Primary proposers: Codex CLI and Claude Code CLI.
148:- Supplemental proposer: Antigravity CLI (`agy`) when the two primary hosts disagree materially, candidate ambiguity remains, either primary host is unavailable/quota-limited, or the reviewer explicitly requests a third semantic perspective.
149:- No host proposal can expand lifecycle authority or satisfy a gate.
150-
151-### 8.2 Fresh-context input
152-
153:The CLI first applies one pre-egress sanitizer to every field and artifact that could enter a host prompt. There is no alternate adapter path around this boundary. The sanitizer:
154-
155-- transmits identifier, command, configuration, and environment-variable names, never detected values;
156-- redacts secret-like values in Story/checklist prose, backticks, error payloads, paths, titles, symbols, seeds, and memory-derived text;
157-- hashes or omits sensitive provenance and `sourceRef` values while retaining a local-only mapping for audit;
158:- rejects and records unsafe host inputs or outputs instead of trying to repair them;
159:- treats uncertain classification as sensitive and skips the host call, continuing with deterministic local routing;
160-- persists only the sanitized request digest and sanitized proposal artifact.
161-
162:After sanitization, each host receives only:
163-
164-- Story ID, title, description, keywords, and risk signals;
165-- checklist title, `userSees`, `excludes`, and related-doc paths;
166-- deterministic seed list with provenance;
167-- changed files/symbols when available;
168-- complete decisions filename/title index, without document bodies;
169-- proposal budget and output schema.
170-
171:The host does not receive the entire requirements corpus, the owner's full conversation, raw secret-bearing metadata, or the local-only provenance map.
172-
173-### 8.3 Output schema
174-
175-```ts
176:interface HostKeywordProposal {
177-  schemaVersion: 'proofbound.keyword-proposal.v1';
178-  storyId: string;
179:  host: 'codex-cli' | 'claude-cli' | 'agy-cli';
180-  proposalId: string;
181-  promptDigest: string;
182-  deterministicSeedDigest: string;
183-  terms: Array<{
184-    term: string;
185-    rationale: string;
186-    kind: 'synonym' | 'legacy-term' | 'domain-term' | 'behavior' |
187-      'failure-mode' | 'command-config' | 'negative-control';
188-    derivedFrom: string[];
189-    confidence: 'high' | 'medium' | 'low';
190-  }>;
191-  rejectedSeeds: Array<{ term: string; reason: string }>;
192-  ambiguitySignals: string[];
193-}
194-```
195-
196:Limits per host:
197-
198-- at most 20 proposed terms;
199-- at most 5 ambiguity signals;
200-- rationale at most 160 characters;
201-- no document-body quotation;
202-- invalid or oversized output is ignored and recorded, never silently repaired into evidence.
