337-## 13. Read evidence
338-
339-`scope_check_save` and later reviewer writes consume both a declared manifest and a mechanical read log:
340-
341-```ts
342-interface ReviewerReadEvidence {
343:  candidateSpecSetDigest: string;
344-  filesReadFully: Array<{ path: string; contentHash: string }>;
345-  filesTriagedByName: string[];
346-  readLogDigest: string;
347-  manifestMatch: boolean;
348-  unreportedReads: string[];
349-  missingDeclaredReads: string[];
350-  scanEscalationReason: string | null;
351-}
