353-
354-Gate behavior:
355-
356:- missing candidate artifact: fail closed when routing is required;
357-- stale corpus/input digest: reroute;
358-- declared/mechanical mismatch: fail closed;
359-- full scan without reason: fail closed;
360-- proposal-only evidence: ignored;
361-- a clean read manifest does not itself prove feature coverage; signed scope mapping still does.
